{"seq":5,"slug":"power-electronics","title":"功率电子","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":2.98,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"功率电子技术\">功率电子技术</h1><p>功率电子是研究电能高效变换与精确控制的工程学科，通过半导体开关器件实现直流与交流之间的双向转换、电压等级的升降变换以及电能质量的调节。从手机充电器中的微型变换器到兆瓦级风力发电并网逆变器，功率电子技术渗透到现代能源系统的每一个环节。</p>\n<p>本知识库以功率半导体器件为起点，系统覆盖 DC-DC 变换器拓扑与控制、整流器/逆变器架构，最终延伸至电源系统级设计（热管理、EMC、电源完整性）。学习路径遵循&quot;器件特性 → 拓扑分析 → 控制设计 → 系统工程&quot;的递进逻辑，帮助建立从单个开关管到完整电源系统的全链路设计能力。</p>\n<p>2026 年，以 SiC 和 GaN 为代表的宽禁带半导体正加速替代传统硅基器件，全球市场规模突破 150 亿美元。800V 高压直流架构成为 AI 数据中心和新能源汽车的标准配置，功率密度提升 3-5 倍、开关损耗降低 80% 以上。理解这些前沿技术演进，是掌握下一代电源设计的关键基础。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"power-semiconductor-devices","title":"功率半导体器件","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-semiconductor-devices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mosfet-igbt-characteristics","title":"MOSFET 与 IGBT 特性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-semiconductor-devices/mosfet-igbt-characteristics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wide-bandgap-sic-gan","title":"SiC/GaN 宽禁带半导体器件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-semiconductor-devices/wide-bandgap-sic-gan"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gate-driver-design","title":"栅极驱动电路设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-semiconductor-devices/gate-driver-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"dc-dc-converters","title":"DC-DC 变换器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/dc-dc-converters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"buck-boost-topologies","title":"Buck/Boost/Buck-Boost 基本拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/dc-dc-converters/buck-boost-topologies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"control-loop-design","title":"控制环路设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/dc-dc-converters/control-loop-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-efficiency-techniques","title":"高效率设计技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/dc-dc-converters/high-efficiency-techniques"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"inverters-rectifiers","title":"整流器与逆变器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/inverters-rectifiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rectifier-pfc-topologies","title":"整流器拓扑与功率因数校正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/inverters-rectifiers/rectifier-pfc-topologies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inverter-topologies","title":"逆变器拓扑分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/inverters-rectifiers/inverter-topologies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grid-tied-inverter-control","title":"并网逆变器控制技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/inverters-rectifiers/grid-tied-inverter-control"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"power-system-design","title":"电源系统设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-system-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thermal-management","title":"热管理与散热设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-system-design/thermal-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emc-emi-design","title":"EMC/EMI 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-system-design/emc-emi-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-integrity-testing","title":"电源完整性与测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/power-electronics/power-system-design/power-integrity-testing"}]}]}